  "factor_name": "Volatility-scaled cross-asset residual reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "-((asset_10d_return - cross_asset_mean_10d_return) / (asset_40d_realized_volatility * sqrt(10)))",
    "description": "For each tradable benchmark instrument, subtract the cross-sectional mean 10-day return from its own 10-day return, reverse the residual, and scale by 40-day realized volatility. The signal is lagged one completed trading day before use. Higher values indicate stronger contrarian preference."
